        "start": 1179.5,
        "duration": 2,
        "hasSignLanguage": false,
        "segmentType": "cv_field_report",
        "cvOverlapPercentage": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "走了好幾個小時",
        "start": 1181.4,
        "duration": 1,
        "hasSignLanguage": false,
        "segmentType": "cv_field_report",
        "cvOverlapPercentage": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "才抵達因山崩跟落石",
        "start": 1182.6,
        "duration": 2,
        "hasSignLanguage": false,
        "segmentType": "cv_field_report",
        "cvOverlapPercentage": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "而完全被隔絕的村落",
        "start": 1184.4,
        "duration": 2,
        "hasSignLanguage": false,
        "segmentType": "cv_field_report",
        "cvOverlapPercentage": 0.0
      },
      {
        "text": "接著持續從瓦礫堆中挖出遺體",
